WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.880
It is time to put those rescue breathing skills to work.

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:06.280
Please head back to your mannequins.

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:08.920
We are going to run through several rounds of practice

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.480
to make sure you feel confident

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.140
in delivering these life-saving breaths.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.080
As you practice rescue breaths,

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.480
your instructor will be checking

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:18.959
to ensure you are getting clear chest rise.

00:00:18.959 --> 00:00:22.400
Remember, we are not looking for big, forceful blows.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.219
We want gentle, steady breaths

00:00:24.219 --> 00:00:26.400
that last about one second each.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.760
Once you've achieved clear chest rise,

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.360
practice combining your skills

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.599
by performing 30 chest compressions,

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:35.880
followed by two effective rescue breaths and repeat.

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.080
You want to move from compressions to breaths

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:41.060
and back again as smoothly and quickly as possible.

